        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Part-time employees, employed twelve (12) months or more who are laid off for lack of work shall have the right to job openings which may occur in their classification within a period not to exceed six (6) months after their date of layoff. If the employee is offered recall and refuses, he/she shall no longer have any recall rights.",
