        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Respecting promotions, the qualifications and ability of the employee shall be considered in conjunction with seniority. The Company agrees to make a sincere effort to train in advance senior employees to fill future higher-rated classifications. Final determination of qualifications shall rest with management which shall be the sole judge of qualifications, and this determination shall not be subject to arbitration.",
